<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission economic forecasts for Spain.</title>
<headline>EU Commission economic forecasts for Spain.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Spain, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		2.8	   3.1</p>
<p> Investment			6.2	   8.3</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    2.4	   2.2</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	   21.3	  20.6</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 3.0	   2.7</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 68.1	  67.2</p>
</text>
